    "mathformer.native_boundary": {
      "execution": "Registered mathformer_sympy_goal_0004_route_* MCP tools reuse native route helpers and run_action; default extra_args=() and seen=None. Unexpected exceptions propagate.",
      "native_environment": "Explicit registry projection resolves only unchanged native capabilities; nullable repository_root selects hub.REPO_ROOT. SelectedMatch preserves the fixed route plus caller score and matched terms.",
      "bounds": "SelectedMatch constrains all nine action_ids; done is true at child nine, so on_exhausted is unreachable under source operations.",
      "timeout": "Initial action timeout is 900 seconds; there is no global timer in run_intent_match.",
      "initial_runner": "run_action owns build_run's single traversal of goal_plan, design_guard_review, repair_expansion_map, recursive_repair_control and grounded_sample_thoroughness. It carries next_stage, workflow_stage_reports, command_metadata and blockers; recorded blockers do not stop traversal. Final status is complete_sympy_physics_derivation only if thoroughness reports that status and blockers are absent; otherwise blocked when blockers exist, else derivation_partial. main returns 3 only for blocked, else 0; route ok follows the native child result, not scientific report classification."
